#requires -Version 5.1
<#
Aliz Shop By Biw Dominic - single-file PowerShell launcher, Windows 10/11 x64.

Run: powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\AlizShop.ps1
Optional local test: add -SelfTest (uses only the application's own test memory).

This file contains the complete AlizShop.exe as ordinary, uncompressed Base64.
There are NO downloads, network requests, compiler requirements or extra files to send.
The embedded executable's SHA-256 is verified before it is run.

At runtime, the program is written to a unique temporary directory and launched
with your current permissions. After a normal exit, its temporary files are removed.
No elevation is requested by this launcher. No security settings are changed.

Version 1.1 requires an Aliz Shop access key before opening the application menu.
The list of issued keys is not included in this download. Checks are local,
with no expiry or device binding; this is a basic gate, not online licensing.

The application reads/writes memory in a FiveM GTA process after confirmation.
Game compatibility has not been verified. RESET restores this app session's saved
bytes only; use RESET before closing the application if you want to undo its changes.

The executable is unsigned. Packaging and local tests are not an antivirus scan.
#>
[CmdletBinding()]
param([switch]$SelfTest)

